        "Content": "Planning secured. Site ready for the next step.\r\n\r\nLocated at Galbolie, just c. 2.9km from Bailieborough, this c. 0.8 acre site comes with full planning permission for a substantial four-bedroom detached home and detached garage.\r\n\r\nWith the planning stage already complete, the focus can move to the build itself. The approved plans provide for a sizeable family home, with the detached garage adding further practical space outside.\r\n\r\nThe location strikes a strong balance. You have an open rural setting, while Bailieborough is only a few minutes away for schools, shops, sports facilities and everyday amenities.\r\n\r\nA strong option for anyone looking to build in the Bailieborough area, with a good-sized site, an accessible location and the major groundwork of securing planning permission already done.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\n– c. 0.8 acre site\r\n– Full planning permission granted\r\n– Substantial four-bedroom detached home\r\n– Planning includes detached garage\r\n– Just c. 2.9km from Bailieborough\r\n- Subject to compliance with 'local needs' planning requirements."
      }
